WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
In Johannesburg, watch the same two-metre wall at midday.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
In midsummer the sun reaches 87°. The wall casts a short shadow.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:21.000
As winter approaches, the midday sun sits lower. The shadow grows southward.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:29.000
In midwinter the sun reaches 40°. The shadow stretches about 2.4 metres.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Here, winter shade falls on the right. The sunny north bed is on the left.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Plant short crops on the north side of a tall wall.
